---
title: News & Updates
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /blog/
wide: true
hero_heading: News and updates
hero_subtext: Progress toward the house, program milestones, and ways to get involved.
meta_description: News and updates from Oasis Women Center in Corinth, Texas.
---

<section class="sec sec-paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if collections.posts | length %}
    <div class="post-list">
      {%- for post in collections.posts %}
      <article class="post-card reveal">
        <p class="post-date">{{ post.date | dateReadable }}</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        {% if post.data.excerpt %}<p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="sec-head center reveal" style="margin-bottom:34px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Coming soon</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Nothing posted <em>just yet</em>.</h2>
      <p class="sec-lead">Updates will land here as we move toward opening the first home. Until then, the fastest way to follow along is to reach out directly.</p>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;" class="reveal d1">
      <a class="btn btn-outline-ink" href="/contact/">Contact us</a>
    </p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
